  "description": "Variation of Condition 1 and removal of Condition 3 attached to planning permission 2025/2093 dated 02/12/2025 to vary the approved drawings to increase the size of the upper ground floor rear extension and to allow full accessibility to the rear terrace.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-ad0e6601-7fff-0ec6-f56f-864cd64909c4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed removal of Condition 3 to allow full access to the roof terrace above the lower ground floor extension would result in direct overlooking of neighbouring properties, resulting in loss of privacy. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy LP2 of the LP33, the London Plan and the NPPF 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed variation of Condition 1 to increase the size of the extension would result in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-b2613d01-7fff-7678-3fa1-c4cc0b1de91a&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;unacceptable overbearing impact and loss of outlook to neighbouring properties&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy LP2 of the LP33, the London Plan and the NPPF 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
